<title>USA: TABLE - Tri-National Development results.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Tri-National Development results.</headline>
<text>
<p>SAN DIEGO, Aug 18 (Reuter)</p>
<p>	  Year ended April 30, 1997	   April 30,1996</p>
<p> Shr			 $0.22		   $0.02</p>
<p> Net		  $3,082,226		 $136,428</p>
<p>NOTE: The Company made several acquisitions and eliminated a major portion of their short-term debt during the year.  The balance sheet now boasts total assets of $22,928,438 and shareholders' equity of $12,496,742.</p>
<p>Based on the Company's assets and current operations, management is now committing to a plan of 25% per year compounded earnings for the next five years.  The plan will be available on the Company's web site at</p>
